     +| REQ-050 | Preserve network interfaces, addresses, resolvers and admin IP inventory. | Scope and address family accurate; VPS assignment includes purpose `any` and all API-authorized location associations (including staging), without inferring availability from primary location; cached detached IPs must be revalidated, including supported network availability. Disabled owned addresses remain visible but cannot be assigned; admin desktop/mobile IP flags warn only on explicit disabled state. Destructive detach requires target review; history obeys REQ-043. | C; network availability request 2026-10-06; [networking](../../src/lib/api/networking.ts), [IP addresses](../../src/lib/api/ipAddresses.ts) | Baseline; staging private IPv4 availability delivered in PR6; network availability prepared, not deployed; fixture evidence only; [release 718cf759](../work-log/2026-09-30-three-site-release.md) |
